Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather round, come take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Theatre of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumpkin Field
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is spending the summer vacation at grandmother's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A story of an elementary school student.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.93,0:00:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I the only one who has to go to Grandma's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.75,0:00:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mom is having a hard time because her belly is so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, fell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then bury it in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.99,0:00:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Field?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.27,0:00:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the rule around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up before you lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:00:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.73,0:01:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too boring and...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't go back to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my little brother is about to be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, i see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're free, let's play together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it evening already? I have to head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Se-See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.90,0:01:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.01,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.69,0:01:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.14,0:01:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s nothing going on, but
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day like this is not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Time flies while you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be even more fun if I had siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.09,0:02:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're heading back to your home in Tokyo soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.47,0:02:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish summer vacation would never end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I grant it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.62,0:02:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Exchange for something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing I can give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.64,0:02:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Something very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.71,0:02:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,come on, let's exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it this field wide like that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.93,0:02:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.27,0:02:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing it didn't amount to anything worse than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ok...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.09,0:03:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ok...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,THE END
